  (text "Dynamic VIN selection: VBUS\n(USB) will override VBAT (LIPO)\nvia D5 when both are present." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 116.84 50.8 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.0795))) (uuid "321faced-a08e-4211-b774-6fc6ca9bb6c5"))
  (text "See: https://devzone.nordicsemi.com/blogs/943/measuring-lithium-battery-voltage-with-nrf52/\nMaximum voltage: 4.2 V * (2 M/(0.8 M+2 M)) = 3 V\nMinimum voltage: 2.7 V * (2 M/(0.8 M+2 M)) = 1.93 V\nADC value at 4.2 V - 12 bit setup: 3 V * (1/5) / 0.6 V * 4095 = 4095\nADC value at 2.7 V - 12 bit setup: 1.93 V * (1/5) / 0.6 V * 4095 = 2634\nUsable ADC resolution - 12 bit setup: 4095 - 2634 = 1461" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 281.94 35.56 0) (effects (font (size 1.778 1.5113)) (justify right bottom)) (uuid "323972f8-7c7b-42ba-9cfa-2d1a76ab5c2b"))
